#: src/features/Blog/blogData.tsx:83
#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid ""
"I recognize this feeling.\n"
"\n"
"I know my own stranger can be wrong. It happens. But rarely enough that "
"questioning him feels awkward. When his answers are structured, articulate, "
"confident, I hesitate. Asking, “Are you absolutely sure?” can feel almost "
"inappropriate — as if I am wasting his time, or exposing my own ignorance.\n"
"\n"
"My stranger is not a person.\n"
"\n"
"We usually call him ChatGPT. And that is where the parallel becomes "
"difficult to ignore.\n"
"\n"
"On the surface, he is easier to “read” than any human being. His tone is "
"stable. His politeness is predictable. His structure is clean. There are no "
"trembling hands, no nervous pauses, no visible signs of hesitation.\n"
"\n"
"That stability may itself create a problem.\n"
"\n"
"In humans, inner doubt often leaks into outward expression. We hear it in "
"hesitation, see it in posture, sense it in tone. With AI, that link is "
"absent. Its voice remains steady regardless of uncertainty. The certainty "
"you hear comes from the way it is built.\n"
"\n"
"You can ask it how to cook “pork wings,” and it may calmly provide a recipe "
"- even if the premise itself is absurd."
msgstr ""
"Prepoznajem ovaj osećaj.\n"
"\n"
"Znam da moj sopstveni stranac može pogrešiti. To se dešava. Ali dovoljno "
"retko da se preispitivanje čini nezgodnim. Kada su njegovi odgovori "
"strukturisani, artikulisani, samouvereni, oklevam. Pitanje, \"Jesi li "
"siguran?\" može delovati gotovo neprikladno — kao da traćim njegovo vreme "
"ili izlažem sopstveno neznanje.\n"
"\n"
"Moj stranac nije osoba.\n"
"\n"
"Obično ga zovemo ChatGPT. I tu paralelu postaje teško ignorisati.\n"
"\n"
"Na površini, lakše ga je \"čitati\" nego bilo kog čoveka. Njegov ton je "
"stabilan. Njegova uljudnost je predvidljiva. Njegova struktura je čista. "
"Nema drhtavih ruku, nervoznih pauza, vidljivih znakova oklevanja.\n"
"\n"
"Ta stabilnost može sama po sebi stvoriti problem.\n"
"\n"
"Kod ljudi, unutrašnja sumnja često se obelodani u spoljašnjem izražaju. "
"Čujemo je u oklevanju, vidimo u držanju, osetimo u tonu. Kod AI-a, ta veza "
"je odsutna. Njegov glas ostaje stabilan bez obzira na neizvesnost. "
"Sigurnost koju čujete potiče od načina na koji je izgrađen.\n"
"\n"
"Možete ga pitati kako da skuvate \"pileća krilca,\" i on može mirno dati "
"recept - čak i ako je sama premisa apsurdna."

