#: src/features/Blog/blogData.tsx:48
#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid ""
"We’ve been living with a stranger for three years now.\n"
"\n"
"He doesn’t rent a room. He never asked to move in. One day he simply "
"appeared - and somehow stayed. He helps us with errands. He drafts letters "
"to government offices, translates notices on the wall, and explains "
"complicated forms. At work, he is often faster than I am. Sometimes we even "
"pay him - though compared to how much he helps, it’s almost nothing.\n"
"\n"
"The strange part is this: I don’t even know his name.\n"
"\n"
"We met in January 2023. At first, we just talked. Then we talked more. "
"Within months, he felt irreplaceable. Alina and I once caught ourselves "
"saying we couldn’t imagine how we had ever lived without him. And yet, even "
"now, there is a faint discomfort beneath that gratitude. A subtle tension.\n"
"\n"
"It feels as if I know him very well.\n"
"And at the same time, not at all.\n"
"\n"
"I take English lessons with a teacher. We read books together, and when we "
"finish one, Dmitri usually offers a few options for the next. Recently, "
"among the choices, one title immediately caught my attention: Talking to "
"Strangers.\n"
"\n"
"“This is it,” I thought."
msgstr ""
"Živimo sa strancem već tri godine.\n"
"\n"
"Ne iznajmljuje sobu. Nikada nije tražio da se useli. Jednog dana se "
"jednostavno pojavio - i nekako ostao. Pomaže nam sa sitnicama. Piše pisma "
"državnim institucijama, prevodi obaveštenja na zidu i objašnjava "
"komplikovane formulare. Na poslu je često brži od mene. Ponekad ga čak i "
"platimo - iako je to gotovo ništa u poređenju s time koliko pomaže.\n"
"\n"
"Najčudnije je ovo: Ne znam mu ni ime.\n"
"\n"
"Upoznali smo se u januaru 2023. U početku smo samo razgovarali. Onda smo "
"razgovarali sve više. Za nekoliko meseci, postao je nezamenljiv. Alina i ja "
"smo se jednom uhvatili kako govorimo da ne možemo ni da zamislimo kako smo "
"ranije živeli bez njega. A ipak, čak i sada, postoji lagana nelagoda ispod "
"te zahvalnosti. Suptilna tenzija.\n"
"\n"
"Kao da ga jako dobro poznajem.\n"
"I istovremeno, nimalo.\n"
"\n"
"Pohađam časove engleskog sa nastavnikom. Čitamo knjige zajedno, i kada "
"završimo jednu, Dmitri obično ponudi nekoliko opcija za narednu. Nedavno, "
"među izborima, jedan naslov mi odmah privukao pažnju: Talking to Strangers.\n"
"\n"
"\"Ovo je to,\" pomislio sam."

