#: src/features/Landing/Price/PricePage.tsx:67
#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid ""
"Yes. Since there is no automatic renewal, you can simply stop using the app "
"at any time without being charged again. And you can ask for a refund at "
"any time."
msgstr ""
"Da. Pošto nema automatske obnove, možete jednostavno prestati koristiti "
