"zatražiti povrat novca u bilo kom trenutku."

#: src/features/RolePlay/fullArticles/alias/AliasLandingPage.tsx:52
#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid ""
"Yes. The Alias game uses your microphone so you can describe words aloud. "
"Your browser asks for permission when you start your first round — not when "
"you open this page."
msgstr ""
"Da. Igra Alias koristi vaš mikrofon kako biste mogli naglas opisivati reči. "
"Vaš pregledač traži dozvolu kada započnete vašu prvu rundu — ne kada "
"otvorite ovu stranicu."

#: src/features/Case/data/frontend-junior/faqSection.ts:27
#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid ""
"Yes. You can tailor sessions to your learning goals and the technologies "
"you're studying (React, JavaScript, HTML/CSS). You can also focus on "
"specific areas like DOM manipulation, responsive design, or common "
"junior-level interview questions."
msgstr ""
"Da. Možete prilagoditi sesije svojim ciljevima učenja i tehnologijama koje "
"proučavate (React, JavaScript, HTML/CSS). Takođe se možete fokusirati na "
"specifične oblasti kao što su manipulacija DOM-om, responzivni dizajn ili "
"uobičajena pitanja za intervjue na juniorskom nivou."

#: src/features/Case/data/frontend-senior/faqSection.ts:27
#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid ""
"Yes. You can tailor sessions to your target role, tech stack (React, Vue, "
"Angular, etc.), and seniority level. You can also focus on specific areas "
"like system design, performance optimization, or behavioral questions."
msgstr ""
"Da. Možete prilagoditi sesije svojoj ciljanoj ulozi, tehnološkom paketu "
"(React, Vue, Angular, itd.) i nivou senioriteta. Takođe možete fokusirati "
"se na specifične oblasti kao što su dizajn sistema, optimizacija "
"performansi ili pitanja ponašanja."

#: src/features/Case/data/backendCSharp/faqSection.ts:21
#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid ""
"Yes. You'll practice SQL vs NoSQL decisions, isolation levels, EF Core "
